  "abstract": "Covers the Agent2Agent (A2A) protocol as published by the Linux Foundation A2A project, with four version lines: A2A 1.0 (current, pinned to specification release v1.0.1 and its normative a2a.proto), the legacy 0.3 and 0.2 lines with upgrades to 1.0, and the A2A 1.1 preview on the dev-1.1 branch (posture: track). SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references cover versions and upgrades, the Agent Card and its security declarations, operations and the three protocol bindings, tasks with streaming and push notifications, and security including signed Agent Cards.",
